<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>治胆怯 - 标签 | 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E6%B2%BB%E8%83%86%E6%80%AF/</link><description>这里不仅是我研习中医经典的私人书斋，更是一处致力于 “观照经典以明医理，颐养身心以扶正气” 的清净之地。</description><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-alpha-mt895zhg</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</webMaster><copyright>本站内容采用 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 国际许可协议。</copyright><lastBuildDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 16:50:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E6%B2%BB%E8%83%86%E6%80%AF/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>腑治法：论小便闭塞 大便闭结 论治胆怯 论肾虚吐呕</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-21-fuzhifa/</link><pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 16:45:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-21-fuzhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%89%E5%B0%84%E9%9B%86/">卷三射集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“腑治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;小便不通、大便闭结、胆怯、肾虚吐呕&lt;/strong&gt;等六腑及奇恒之腑病症的辨治法则。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;治腑病不专在腑，而当求之脏&lt;/strong&gt;。或补心气以化膀胱，或滋肾润肺以通大肠，或补肾生肝以壮胆气，或温肾暖脾以止呕吐。此即“腑病治脏”之法。</description></item></channel></rss>